WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song Of The Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 5]

01:49.259 --> 01:50.229
Lu Sheng.

01:50.570 --> 01:51.610
After I leave,

01:51.610 --> 01:53.210
remember to pick some pears.

01:53.460 --> 01:55.110
Practice magic more often.

01:55.380 --> 01:56.380
Don't waste time.

01:57.910 --> 01:59.140
Supreme God,

01:59.140 --> 02:01.790
I will follow your instructions.

02:04.620 --> 02:05.550
Lu Sheng.

02:09.530 --> 02:12.230
[Immortal Palace, Four Seasons Monument]

02:11.500 --> 02:12.420
You promised

02:12.420 --> 02:14.620
to follow my instructions, didn't you?

02:20.579 --> 02:22.640
How much longer do you want me to wait?

02:38.890 --> 02:39.900
Who are you?

02:39.900 --> 02:40.900
Tell me your name.

02:46.020 --> 02:47.150
Demon King in White?

02:47.660 --> 02:48.910
Why is he here?

02:51.900 --> 02:52.870
Miss Liu Shao.

02:54.500 --> 02:55.530
My name is Kho.

02:55.530 --> 02:56.510
I belong to you.

02:57.820 --> 02:58.930
You belong to me?

02:58.930 --> 02:59.950
Kho?

03:01.980 --> 03:04.110
What is he talking about...

03:08.180 --> 03:09.980
You were in a hurry to chase the spider demon,

03:09.980 --> 03:11.040
and dropped me out.

03:37.740 --> 03:39.870
This demon looks good.

03:45.829 --> 03:48.510
This guy is up to no good.

03:51.460 --> 03:52.660
You mean

03:52.660 --> 03:55.860
your master, Demon King in White, had a fight with someone

03:56.660 --> 03:58.070
and got injured.

03:58.070 --> 03:59.980
Then he left you alone

03:59.980 --> 04:01.550
to run your own course?

04:03.980 --> 04:05.620
I'm just a little fish demon.

04:05.620 --> 04:07.110
My life doesn't matter.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.480
A fish demon's life should also be respected.

04:09.480 --> 04:10.700
This doesn't make sense.

04:10.700 --> 04:11.300
That...

04:11.300 --> 04:13.160
That Demon King in White is awful.

04:14.980 --> 04:16.850
How could he even abandon his own clansman?

04:16.850 --> 04:19.110
He doesn't deserve to be Head of the clan.

04:21.459 --> 04:22.680
I also think this Demon King

04:22.680 --> 04:23.800
is awful.

04:25.540 --> 04:27.400
When he ran into powerful demons,

04:27.700 --> 04:29.810
he would just turn around and run away.

04:29.810 --> 04:31.210
But when it's our little Liu Shao,

04:31.210 --> 04:32.870
he would snatch her treasure.

04:33.700 --> 04:34.720
He is really

04:34.720 --> 04:36.300
cowardly and despicable

04:36.300 --> 04:37.830
without a little bit shame.

04:38.700 --> 04:39.820
How could he promote himself

04:39.820 --> 04:41.240
as a kind, generous,

04:41.240 --> 04:42.590
and polite Demon King?

04:43.220 --> 04:43.630
Bah!

04:44.140 --> 04:45.140
He's just a scumbag.

04:45.140 --> 04:46.340
A typical hypocrite.

04:46.540 --> 04:47.080
Bah!

04:47.659 --> 04:48.780
I thought I met

04:48.780 --> 04:50.380
a good man who was righteous.

04:50.620 --> 04:52.390
But it turns out that he's just a scumbag.

04:52.390 --> 04:52.970
Scum!

04:52.970 --> 04:53.420
Scumbag!

04:53.420 --> 04:54.040
Scum!

04:54.040 --> 04:54.750
Scum!

05:02.980 --> 05:03.800
Damn fish demon.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.310
You don't look well.

05:05.860 --> 05:06.640
Are you okay?

05:08.180 --> 05:09.110
Are you okay?

05:10.780 --> 05:11.510
Are you okay?

05:11.900 --> 05:12.630
Are you okay?

05:13.460 --> 05:14.200
Are you okay?

05:17.340 --> 05:17.910
I'm fine.

05:18.300 --> 05:20.760
Maybe I've been away from water for too long.

05:22.660 --> 05:23.520
Then that means

05:23.580 --> 05:24.980
you've been dehydrated.

05:25.490 --> 05:26.070
Fattie.

05:27.300 --> 05:28.100
Leave it to me.

05:32.500 --> 05:33.830
Demon King in White,

05:34.460 --> 05:35.800
I'll teach you a lesson.

05:35.800 --> 05:37.330
Since you know my identity,

05:37.659 --> 05:38.990
why don't you leave now?

05:39.210 --> 05:40.900
I don't fear you.

05:42.140 --> 05:43.790
What's wrong with them?

05:43.790 --> 05:45.659
They haven't met before, have they?

05:45.659 --> 05:46.630
Wait.

05:47.140 --> 05:48.350
I'll kill you.

05:49.050 --> 05:50.710
Let's see what you can do to me.

06:07.900 --> 06:09.050
You damn fish demon!

06:09.050 --> 06:10.550
Has the fish become a demon?

06:10.550 --> 06:12.210
It's originally a fish demon.

06:14.500 --> 06:15.790
Kho, are you alright?

06:16.820 --> 06:17.310
Kho!

06:17.740 --> 06:18.340
Kho!

06:19.740 --> 06:20.470
Don't worry.

06:20.900 --> 06:22.380
Even if something happens to us,

06:22.380 --> 06:23.980
it can still stay unscathed.

06:25.540 --> 06:26.020
You...

06:27.700 --> 06:29.350
Did I wet your clothes?

06:29.350 --> 06:30.470
I'm sorry.

06:30.470 --> 06:31.770
I've indeed been away from water for too long.

06:31.770 --> 06:33.510
I can't help it when I see water.

06:35.100 --> 06:36.390
You're still alive?

06:37.140 --> 06:38.070
That's great.

06:38.070 --> 06:38.600
Brother,

06:39.180 --> 06:40.700
We haven't caught a demon yet.

06:40.700 --> 06:42.560
Let's get him back and hand him in.

06:43.390 --> 06:44.790
You're so smart.

06:45.180 --> 06:45.670
No.

06:45.940 --> 06:47.130
This is my demon.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.730
How can you hand it in? No way.

06:50.420 --> 06:51.420
Look, my Miss

06:51.420 --> 06:53.950
is the only one with beauty and kindness here.

06:54.100 --> 06:54.710
Liu Shao.

06:54.980 --> 06:55.510
He is...

07:04.780 --> 07:05.740
This guy's still pretending...

07:05.740 --> 07:07.070
Fine, you can continue.

07:07.340 --> 07:09.670
I'll see how long you can keep pretending.

07:10.140 --> 07:11.660
Because of this spider demon,

07:11.660 --> 07:13.380
we really have to go back empty-handed.

07:13.380 --> 07:15.640
We'll definitely get punished again...

07:16.790 --> 07:19.740
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

07:22.700 --> 07:24.500
I think I know what happened now.

07:24.540 --> 07:25.190
However,

07:25.860 --> 07:27.710
you didn't get any prey.

07:28.740 --> 07:31.420
And you indeed came back empty-handed.

07:32.020 --> 07:33.150
I have to punish you.

07:35.659 --> 07:36.240
Lord,

07:37.180 --> 07:39.110
it was I that led the team this time.

07:39.180 --> 07:41.220
I'm willing to get punished alone for them.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.450
In that case,

07:42.450 --> 07:43.750
I'll punish you

07:49.380 --> 07:51.370
to clean the Pearl Pavilion for a month,

07:51.370 --> 07:52.370
what do you think?

07:58.900 --> 08:00.460
-Thank you, Lord. -Thank you, Lord.

08:00.460 --> 08:01.040
Lu Li.

08:01.620 --> 08:03.520
You promised to get the King Herb for me.

08:03.520 --> 08:04.450
Don't forget it.

08:05.780 --> 08:06.580
You may leave.

08:19.020 --> 08:20.430
Call Du Mingchong here.

08:21.500 --> 08:21.870
Yes.

08:34.150 --> 08:35.760
[Bird Demon]

08:42.539 --> 08:43.190
Chong.

08:43.190 --> 08:45.560
Lu Li's team came back empty-handed.

08:46.380 --> 08:47.380
What do you think?

08:49.140 --> 08:50.310
He let you down.

08:50.620 --> 08:52.420
He should be punished severely.

08:57.940 --> 08:58.950
But I think

09:00.650 --> 09:02.110
you disappointed me more.

09:05.260 --> 09:06.200
I don't understand.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.460
You don't understand?

09:07.750 --> 09:10.480
[Wu]

09:09.580 --> 09:10.590
On the 13th day of the first lunar month,

09:10.480 --> 09:13.640
[Spider Demon]

09:11.060 --> 09:11.950
Du Mingchong

09:12.500 --> 09:15.140
hunted a spider demon at the East Mountain Pass.

09:15.140 --> 09:16.110
Male.

09:16.500 --> 09:17.190
Long hair.

09:17.660 --> 09:19.080
200 years of demon power.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.460
It was because of my carelessness

09:20.460 --> 09:21.420
that the demon escaped.

09:21.420 --> 09:22.860
Sorry for not reporting it in time.

09:22.860 --> 09:24.260
Please forgive me, Lord.

09:27.900 --> 09:30.430
Was it really a matter of your being careless?

09:31.620 --> 09:33.190
Or maybe you did it on purpose?

09:31.730 --> 09:33.130
[Bird demon, Spider Demon]

09:33.540 --> 09:35.160
You know it clearly.

09:36.020 --> 09:37.520
I really didn't notice it when it ran away.

09:37.520 --> 09:38.480
I swear.

09:38.480 --> 09:39.610
Please listen to me.

09:40.150 --> 09:40.750
Forget it.

09:43.700 --> 09:45.030
I don't mind it anymore.

09:47.020 --> 09:47.820
You may leave.

09:50.890 --> 09:51.360
Yes.

10:04.700 --> 10:06.070
Don't let me down again.

10:13.620 --> 10:14.750
I always hope

10:15.140 --> 10:16.540
he can do the right thing,

10:16.660 --> 10:17.790
be on the right path,

10:17.860 --> 10:18.990
and become

10:20.020 --> 10:21.550
the future Marquis Wuyang.

10:23.180 --> 10:25.510
After all, he is the son of your old friend.

10:27.260 --> 10:28.270
What a pity.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.360
But

10:35.540 --> 10:36.670
Lu Li...

10:48.650 --> 10:49.190
Master.

10:50.100 --> 10:50.710
Feng.

10:51.940 --> 10:53.070
Why are you back?

10:53.980 --> 10:54.940
I thought

10:54.940 --> 10:56.670
you've been suffering a cough.

10:57.300 --> 10:58.290
In the past,

10:58.290 --> 11:00.260
my junior fellow was here looking after you.

11:00.260 --> 11:00.830
Now,

11:01.220 --> 11:03.480
he has gone to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

11:03.700 --> 11:05.620
I was afraid that you would be left alone,

11:05.620 --> 11:07.790
so I brought some herbal medicines.

11:13.700 --> 11:15.220
The Chuanbei herb-pear juice

11:15.220 --> 11:16.620
was bought by him, right?

11:17.860 --> 11:18.870
He's meddlesome.

11:19.660 --> 11:21.350
I'm used to it.

11:22.340 --> 11:23.750
How is Li?

11:28.380 --> 11:29.190
Not bad.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.550
He went through a lot with Liu Shao.

11:34.300 --> 11:36.700
After all, Liu Shao is a spoiled young lady.

11:36.900 --> 11:38.150
She's new to the Marquis' Mansion.

11:38.150 --> 11:40.150
Li should help him from time to time.

11:40.340 --> 11:41.510
With his guidance,

11:41.900 --> 11:44.300
Liu Shao's cultivation has improved a lot.

11:46.450 --> 11:48.380
Did he ever mention the Moon Sword?

11:50.180 --> 11:51.630
Well,

11:53.540 --> 11:56.060
maybe he's been too busy with helping Liu Shao,

11:56.060 --> 11:58.630
and had no time to care about the Moon Sword.

12:04.420 --> 12:05.900
You mean

12:05.900 --> 12:07.590
he only cares about Liu Shao

12:08.700 --> 12:10.460
and hasn't kept mind

12:10.460 --> 12:11.790
on what I told him to do?

12:12.820 --> 12:14.580
No, Master.

12:14.580 --> 12:16.040
The Moon Sword is so important.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.750
He will remember it.

12:34.890 --> 12:37.040
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

12:38.300 --> 12:38.830
Brother.

12:39.260 --> 12:39.910
I'm ready.

12:41.540 --> 12:42.280
For what?

12:42.280 --> 12:44.010
We should share weal and woe together.

12:44.010 --> 12:46.010
How can we let you be punished alone?

12:47.660 --> 12:48.550
Such a good boy.

12:49.460 --> 12:50.520
But think about it.

12:50.920 --> 12:52.930
If you share the woe with me,

12:52.930 --> 12:55.390
then Xue also has to suffer together with us.

12:55.950 --> 12:57.150
She just recovered.

12:57.500 --> 12:58.900
Don't you care about her?

12:59.020 --> 12:59.990
Care about her?

13:00.660 --> 13:01.670
No.

13:03.330 --> 13:05.590
Wait, it seems that I care about her.

13:07.180 --> 13:09.180
Besides, Liu Shao will go with me.

13:09.450 --> 13:11.450
You two don't have to worry about it.

13:21.740 --> 13:23.940
You're injured. I'm worried about you.

13:24.700 --> 13:26.160
I'm worried about you too.

13:32.460 --> 13:34.220
Tell me, do you think I look good?

13:34.220 --> 13:35.390
Actually...

13:37.660 --> 13:38.510
Actually,

13:39.220 --> 13:40.680
you also think I look good,

13:41.540 --> 13:42.040
right?

14:02.500 --> 14:03.920
Master?

14:15.060 --> 14:15.660
Master.

14:16.380 --> 14:17.310
Why are you here?

14:19.330 --> 14:21.830
I heard that you'd been busy lately.

14:22.180 --> 14:23.470
So I came to see you.

14:23.940 --> 14:24.750
Actually,

14:25.020 --> 14:25.990
I'm fine.

14:26.740 --> 14:27.820
The Demon King in White

14:27.820 --> 14:29.260
sneaked into Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

14:29.260 --> 14:30.120
so I was thinking about

14:30.120 --> 14:31.140
how to get the King Herb back

14:31.140 --> 14:32.180
from him.

14:33.260 --> 14:34.590
Was it for the King Herb,

14:35.020 --> 14:35.990
or for Liu Shao?

14:40.900 --> 14:41.730
Master.

14:42.380 --> 14:44.330
We took so much money from her.

14:44.740 --> 14:45.770
If she is in danger,

14:45.770 --> 14:47.350
we have to protect her, don't we?

14:47.350 --> 14:49.950
You kept no mind on the tasks I gave you, did you?

14:51.460 --> 14:53.790
Instead, you care so much about this girl!

14:54.380 --> 14:56.510
I remember you hated her.

14:56.860 --> 14:58.920
You didn't even want to come with her.

14:59.300 --> 15:00.030
Actually,

15:00.380 --> 15:01.900
after getting along with her,

15:01.900 --> 15:02.840
I found that

15:02.840 --> 15:03.640
she's ctually

15:03.660 --> 15:04.630
not that spoiled.

15:04.630 --> 15:05.560
She's hardworking,

15:05.560 --> 15:06.660
and sincere.

15:07.090 --> 15:07.630
Master,

15:07.970 --> 15:09.630
she's not good-for-nothing.

15:15.090 --> 15:17.090
Have you gotten enamoured with her?

15:17.100 --> 15:17.590
No.

15:18.020 --> 15:18.950
How could it be?

15:22.180 --> 15:23.030
Master

15:23.860 --> 15:25.710
doesn't want me to be with her?

15:28.060 --> 15:29.320
You can't be together.

15:31.140 --> 15:31.670
Why?

15:32.940 --> 15:34.400
Master, you don't like her?

15:34.400 --> 15:35.940
So you asked me to approach her

15:35.940 --> 15:38.600
just because she can help me draw the Moon Sword?

15:39.210 --> 15:41.270
It doesn't matter if I like her or not.

15:41.300 --> 15:43.220
You should know her spirit fire

15:43.220 --> 15:45.510
is incompatible with yours.

15:46.220 --> 15:47.190
You know it.

15:47.620 --> 15:48.950
I don't need to explain.

15:57.020 --> 15:58.470
You can only get each other restrained

15:58.470 --> 15:59.430
and impaired.

16:00.600 --> 16:02.750
Your fate is also in opposition.

16:03.380 --> 16:05.870
You're destined to get each other impaired.

16:06.640 --> 16:07.970
Your love for each other

16:08.640 --> 16:10.370
can only get both of you harmed.

16:11.020 --> 16:13.150
You wanted to know where you were from,

16:13.910 --> 16:16.900
and that was why I asked you to enter Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

16:16.900 --> 16:18.790
It was for making you draw the Moon Sword,

16:18.790 --> 16:21.150
not for letting you fall in love.

16:38.990 --> 16:41.250
This is called "Soul-Devouring Spell".

16:41.720 --> 16:43.860
I planted it in your body.

16:44.620 --> 16:47.090
As long as you have any affection for Liu Shao,

16:47.090 --> 16:49.670
the spell will get stimulated,

16:50.330 --> 16:52.900
and break out from your heart and mouth.

16:54.220 --> 16:56.620
If you don't draw back from loving Liu Shao,

16:57.550 --> 17:01.010
the spell will run through your body along with your vitality,

17:01.370 --> 17:03.260
making your blood vessels burst apart

17:03.260 --> 17:04.670
and bringing you the intolerable pain.

17:04.670 --> 17:07.470
When the spell returns back to your palms,

17:08.640 --> 17:10.160
you absolutely will die.

17:11.450 --> 17:13.310
You'd better do yourself a favor!

17:14.180 --> 17:17.510
I don't need a useless disciple.

17:43.920 --> 17:46.030
What is Lu Li doing?

17:46.440 --> 17:47.640
Why isn't he here yet?

17:51.480 --> 17:54.680
[Pearl Pavilion]

18:05.460 --> 18:07.100
Lu Li, what were you doing?

18:07.100 --> 18:08.300
What took you so long?

18:12.140 --> 18:13.270
I was thinking about

18:13.270 --> 18:15.600
getting the King Herb as soon as possible.

18:15.750 --> 18:17.080
Then one day, if I leave,

18:17.180 --> 18:19.360
you can have a foothold in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion when being alone.

18:19.360 --> 18:20.290
What?

18:21.300 --> 18:22.500
You're leaving?

18:29.570 --> 18:30.300
Don't worry.

18:35.580 --> 18:36.510
I'm not leaving.

18:50.280 --> 18:50.760
You...

18:50.760 --> 18:51.460
You

18:51.750 --> 18:53.030
took my money.

18:53.030 --> 18:54.350
If you leave, you have to compensate me.

18:54.350 --> 18:55.170
Ten times the price.

18:55.170 --> 18:56.380
No, 100 times.

19:00.020 --> 19:01.150
I can't afford to it.

19:01.320 --> 19:03.180
Then you're not allowed to leave.

19:15.640 --> 19:17.450
[Pearl Pavilion]

19:18.160 --> 19:20.430
[Pearl Pavilion]

19:24.380 --> 19:26.660
Why did you threaten me to leave?

19:28.540 --> 19:30.190
Is your master sick again

19:30.720 --> 19:31.780
and short of money?

19:32.230 --> 19:32.790
No.

19:33.280 --> 19:35.280
You brought little fish demon here?

19:37.230 --> 19:38.010
Damn fish demon!

19:38.010 --> 19:38.540
Come out!

19:42.900 --> 19:43.430
Liu Shao!

19:50.590 --> 19:52.020
The servant

19:52.430 --> 19:53.430
of the Demon King.

19:54.950 --> 19:55.850
Do you know

19:56.260 --> 19:57.480
where your lord

19:57.890 --> 19:58.950
put the King Herb?

20:13.220 --> 20:14.280
Don't stand there.

20:15.490 --> 20:16.550
I'm just a servant.

20:17.170 --> 20:18.770
I don't know what My Lord did.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.570
Don't give him a hard time.

20:21.670 --> 20:22.230
Get to work.

20:22.230 --> 20:22.760
Let's go.

20:50.430 --> 20:50.780
Hey!

20:51.570 --> 20:52.290
Why? Why?

20:52.790 --> 20:53.510
Why? Why?

20:53.880 --> 20:54.380
Why

20:54.380 --> 20:55.100
should I take so much,

20:55.100 --> 20:56.630
while he's taking nothing?

20:58.620 --> 20:59.350
Are you done?

20:59.420 --> 20:59.770
Yes.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.440
Get back to work.

21:02.910 --> 21:03.840
Leave the basin.

21:08.830 --> 21:10.360
Although this place is old,

21:10.510 --> 21:11.970
it's with archaic beauty.

21:13.370 --> 21:14.760
You little demon,

21:15.130 --> 21:16.440
can you stop flirting?

21:17.440 --> 21:18.160
Go clean up.

21:19.120 --> 21:19.530
Over there.

21:19.530 --> 21:20.760
See? It's dirty over there.

21:20.760 --> 21:21.480
Clean it up.

21:21.850 --> 21:22.270
Hurry.

21:22.270 --> 21:23.470
Is he capable of that?

21:26.340 --> 21:27.540
He's just a fish,

21:27.540 --> 21:28.600
not the Demon King.

21:28.910 --> 21:30.640
Even Miss Liu can manage it.

21:31.260 --> 21:33.270
How can Miss Liu's demon be incapable of it?

21:33.270 --> 21:34.880
What do you think?

21:36.090 --> 21:37.270
Mr. Lu is right.

21:37.640 --> 21:39.170
Don't bully honest people.

21:41.340 --> 21:41.770
Me?

21:42.300 --> 21:43.500
Who is the honest one?

21:44.110 --> 21:45.380
Don't bully my demon.

21:49.320 --> 21:50.120
Stop looking!

21:50.450 --> 21:51.250
I'll beat you.

21:51.540 --> 21:52.470
Get back to work.

22:06.240 --> 22:07.170
Damn fish demon!

22:07.590 --> 22:09.180
Fish Demon, you did it on purpose!

22:09.180 --> 22:10.310
You were fooling me!

22:11.580 --> 22:12.630
I didn't mean it.

22:12.630 --> 22:13.690
I'm cleaning.

22:18.300 --> 22:19.110
Come on.

22:19.110 --> 22:20.370
Let me help you put the books in order.

22:20.370 --> 22:20.900
Mr. Lu,

22:20.900 --> 22:21.940
books shouldn't be placed like this.

22:21.940 --> 22:22.870
Demon King in White,

22:22.870 --> 22:24.240
don't think I fear you.

22:24.240 --> 22:24.680
If you don't stop acting recklessly,

22:24.680 --> 22:26.340
Miss Liu Shao will punish you.

22:26.340 --> 22:26.990
Here you go!

22:26.990 --> 22:27.970
Stop fighting!

22:33.290 --> 22:34.310
Stop!

22:34.310 --> 22:35.900
What are you doing?

22:46.310 --> 22:47.940
Are you two trying to rebel?

22:47.940 --> 22:49.170
Look at what you've done.

22:49.170 --> 22:50.400
He started the fight.

22:50.400 --> 22:51.920
The broom started it.

22:51.920 --> 22:53.130
What are you talking about?

22:53.130 --> 22:55.860
Stop arguing. Just think about how to clean it up.

22:56.300 --> 22:58.900
Or I'll make you into sugar-stewed pear juice.

23:00.380 --> 23:01.100
And you.

23:01.970 --> 23:02.960
I'll chop you

23:02.960 --> 23:04.010
into fillets

23:04.010 --> 23:05.210
for stewing pickles.

23:08.690 --> 23:10.600
Unfortunately, I'm not a real pear.

23:10.600 --> 23:12.220
I wonder if this guy in front of us

23:12.220 --> 23:13.700
is a real carp.

23:16.800 --> 23:17.480
I'm sorry.

23:18.020 --> 23:18.880
It was my fault.

23:19.070 --> 23:20.060
Of course it was your fault.

23:20.060 --> 23:21.390
Can't you stop arguing?

23:25.830 --> 23:27.060
Look at these books.

23:28.180 --> 23:29.320
We need to get them sorted out

23:29.320 --> 23:30.520
and put back in order.

23:31.210 --> 23:33.230
Can we make it in a month?

24:31.890 --> 24:33.120
This is...

24:33.120 --> 24:34.260
You cast the spell?

24:36.220 --> 24:37.360
You cast it?

24:43.190 --> 24:44.870
Is this book a demon too?

24:44.870 --> 24:46.520
It can get itself sorted.

24:48.570 --> 24:49.700
I heard

24:49.700 --> 24:51.590
there was an ancient book from the Immortal Palace left in the mortal world.

24:51.590 --> 24:53.000
It's called "Magic Plant Code".

24:53.000 --> 24:54.400
It's a rare magic weapon.

24:54.490 --> 24:58.020
With the Code, any plants in the Three Realms can be cultivated.

24:59.990 --> 25:01.780
Any plants?

25:02.220 --> 25:04.080
Including the King Herb?

25:04.780 --> 25:05.580
That's right.

25:07.430 --> 25:08.360
I know what to do!

25:31.990 --> 25:34.770
[Fairyland in the Code]

25:38.210 --> 25:39.070
It's so lively.

25:58.330 --> 25:59.260
I think

25:59.260 --> 26:01.120
this must be the world in the Code.

26:01.230 --> 26:02.080
I think so.

26:05.340 --> 26:06.140
Little demon.

26:06.310 --> 26:07.170
What do you think

26:07.170 --> 26:08.290
about this?

26:09.080 --> 26:10.560
At least the things here

26:10.560 --> 26:11.650
should be real.

26:15.970 --> 26:17.880
I wonder if there's a herbal medicine shop here.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.610
I hope we can find the King Herb.

26:20.460 --> 26:21.850
We have to find it anyway.

26:21.850 --> 26:24.180
Why don't we wander around and look for it?

26:24.490 --> 26:25.020
Let's go.

26:31.620 --> 26:33.020
I'll try something else.

26:33.110 --> 26:33.970
Try some.

26:38.690 --> 26:39.820
It looks delicious.

26:40.070 --> 26:40.850
How much is this?

26:40.850 --> 26:42.950
"Grasswort picked for half a day can't fill up the basket,

26:42.950 --> 26:44.870
I missed my husband so much and left the basket on the road."

26:44.020 --> 26:45.950
["Grasswort picked for half a day can't fill up the basket, I missed my husband so much and left the basket on the road."]

26:52.210 --> 26:53.070
Let me tell you.

26:53.390 --> 26:55.490
Such vendors who can read poems

26:55.490 --> 26:57.640
will surely ask for a high price.

26:58.010 --> 26:59.070
Let me deal with it.

27:04.180 --> 27:05.260
You illiteratus.

27:05.260 --> 27:06.380
You're unlearned.

27:06.380 --> 27:07.900
How dare you insult me

27:07.900 --> 27:08.980
with money!

27:09.940 --> 27:11.100
You are not welcomed here.

27:11.100 --> 27:12.100
Leave here, Miss.

27:13.170 --> 27:13.590
Just leave.

27:13.590 --> 27:14.140
-This isn't money. -Leave here.

27:14.140 --> 27:15.140
-It's a golden leaf. -You're not welcomed here.

27:15.140 --> 27:15.940
I don't want you to be my customer.

27:15.940 --> 27:16.670
It's golden.

27:16.820 --> 27:17.390
Enough.

27:17.390 --> 27:18.000
-Ignorant girl. -Let's go.

27:18.000 --> 27:19.190
What does he mean?

27:19.470 --> 27:21.330
He thinks we are illiterate.

27:22.660 --> 27:23.170
-What? -Let's go.

27:23.170 --> 27:24.090
Stop it.

27:24.090 --> 27:24.820
Here you are.

27:27.740 --> 27:29.150
Cotton candy!

27:29.150 --> 27:30.360
How much is this?

27:30.360 --> 27:31.300
It's free.

27:31.300 --> 27:33.050
Everything here is free.

27:35.260 --> 27:36.320
Free?

27:38.140 --> 27:40.600
This world in the Code respect talent and knowledge most.

27:40.600 --> 27:42.950
["Let's pick plantains, let's get plantains."]

27:40.750 --> 27:42.700
As long as you can tell the ingredients indicated by the poems,

27:42.700 --> 27:44.100
you'll get what are sold.

27:50.880 --> 27:52.610
"Grasswort picked for half a day can't fill up the basket,

27:52.610 --> 27:55.870
I missed my husband so much and left the basket on the road."

28:02.480 --> 28:03.230
Grasswort,

28:03.570 --> 28:04.700
the sprout of the Xanthium,

28:04.700 --> 28:06.230
can cure cold and headache.

28:07.350 --> 28:08.780
Impressive!

28:11.720 --> 28:12.810
Such a talent. If you want anything,

28:12.810 --> 28:13.540
just take it.

28:16.880 --> 28:17.680
Have a taste.

28:23.560 --> 28:24.490
It's delicious.

28:27.800 --> 28:29.230
I won't let you win...

28:29.610 --> 28:31.340
It's just to recognize plants.

28:31.500 --> 28:32.830
What's so hard about it?

28:34.610 --> 28:36.580
"Let's pick plantains,

28:36.580 --> 28:38.600
let's get plantains."

28:40.230 --> 28:40.950
This is it.

28:42.500 --> 28:43.230
Here you are.

28:43.430 --> 28:44.640
["Grasswort picked for half a day can't fill up the basket, I missed my husband so much and left the basket on the road."]

28:45.570 --> 28:46.580
That's easy.

28:46.870 --> 28:48.260
Mr. Lu is indeed knowledgeable.

28:48.260 --> 28:49.890
You even know this herb!

28:51.200 --> 28:52.710
Grass named "Carefree".

28:52.710 --> 28:53.670
It's Carefree Grass.

28:53.670 --> 28:54.730
I can't lose to him.

28:55.310 --> 28:56.240
["Let's pick plantains, let's get plantains."]

28:58.420 --> 28:59.180
"Zhaoyan" [flower],

28:59.180 --> 29:01.130
it blooms at dawn and withers at dusk.

29:01.130 --> 29:01.700
Let's go.

29:03.630 --> 29:04.680
["I climbed up the hill and collected fritillaries to drive away my sadness; women are sentimental but also have their principles."]

29:05.010 --> 29:05.770
Chickweed.

29:05.770 --> 29:06.570
Indigofera.

29:07.360 --> 29:08.330
Xu Changqing!

29:08.330 --> 29:09.670
This old demon...

29:09.670 --> 29:10.850
He's so proud of his living a few hundred years longer than me

29:10.850 --> 29:11.730
and reading a few more books than me.

29:11.730 --> 29:12.490
Shameless!

29:14.000 --> 29:15.220
If you're angry about it,

29:15.220 --> 29:16.420
then read more books.

29:19.380 --> 29:21.040
This place is really special.

29:21.430 --> 29:23.450
Neither money nor martial arts are pursued.

29:23.450 --> 29:25.310
Only knowledge is highly valued.

29:25.680 --> 29:27.540
People here must be interesting.

29:31.850 --> 29:33.240
Even you don't know it?

29:37.810 --> 29:38.540
Here you are.

29:41.050 --> 29:42.430
The character "蝱" in the poem

29:42.430 --> 29:43.950
refers to the fritillary grass, right?

29:43.950 --> 29:44.490
Yes.

29:45.500 --> 29:47.310
This plant name is rarely-seen.

29:47.310 --> 29:48.770
How did you come to know it?

29:49.240 --> 29:50.440
My master has a cough.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.880
He always eats this.

30:02.720 --> 30:06.250
There's really someone able to pass the test of the spirit fire.

30:11.670 --> 30:13.140
The one who obtained the spirit fire

30:13.140 --> 30:15.240
is the female disciple of our sect, Liu Shao.

30:15.240 --> 30:16.960
The one who brought the spirit fire out

30:16.960 --> 30:18.890
was another disciple, Lu Li.

30:19.690 --> 30:22.080
Liu Shao, Lu Li?

30:22.510 --> 30:23.800
Yes.

30:23.800 --> 30:24.810
Unfortunately,

30:25.360 --> 30:26.660
they haven't

30:26.810 --> 30:28.540
brought back the King Herb yet.

30:29.430 --> 30:31.740
The demons are rampant in the Three Realms now.

30:31.740 --> 30:33.540
I lost eighty percent of my power

30:33.710 --> 30:35.440
because of saving Lu Li.

30:35.940 --> 30:37.660
If a powerful demon attacks,

30:37.660 --> 30:40.120
I'm afraid I won't be able to repel the enemy.

30:41.150 --> 30:42.240
Immortal Master,

30:43.000 --> 30:44.510
the spiritual power of Liu Shao is abnormal.

30:44.510 --> 30:45.390
I'm wondering

30:46.400 --> 30:48.620
if we can use her power

30:49.590 --> 30:52.050
to eliminate the demons in the mortal world.

30:52.360 --> 30:54.970
Don't act rashly.

30:54.970 --> 30:59.750
The decision should be made after it's discussed in the Immortal Palace.

30:59.750 --> 31:03.870
Now, I can help you absorb the power of the spirit fire

31:03.870 --> 31:05.970
to restore some of your vitality.

31:06.390 --> 31:08.660
It can help with the emergency for the time being.

31:08.660 --> 31:10.520
Then you can go find the King Herb.

31:12.060 --> 31:13.660
When the mortal world is in trouble,

31:13.660 --> 31:16.460
the Immortal Palace won't stand by and do nothing.

31:16.810 --> 31:18.440
Thank you, Immortal Master.

31:18.880 --> 31:19.520
Good.

31:21.260 --> 31:21.940
Good.

31:23.020 --> 31:24.420
Good!

31:25.420 --> 31:26.680
-So beautiful. -Nice.

31:27.200 --> 31:27.850
Again.

31:29.530 --> 31:32.810
"The reeds are pale; the dew becomes frost".

31:31.590 --> 31:32.760
[To create wonders with a brush.]

31:33.440 --> 31:36.670
The person I love is on the other side of the water.

31:36.670 --> 31:38.010
I know the answer.

31:38.010 --> 31:39.860
It should be reeds!

31:44.690 --> 31:46.120
You are so brilliant, Miss.

31:46.120 --> 31:47.000
In that case,

31:47.000 --> 31:48.220
how about I draw a picture for you

31:48.220 --> 31:49.270
as a souvenir?

31:50.400 --> 31:51.830
We don't want pictures.

31:51.830 --> 31:53.390
We're here for the King Herb.

31:53.390 --> 31:54.190
Do you know it?

31:55.570 --> 31:56.870
I don't know.

31:56.870 --> 31:58.640
Since you passed my test,

31:58.640 --> 31:59.980
I should draw a picture for you.

31:59.980 --> 32:02.160
Look, it's a beautiful day

32:02.160 --> 32:03.960
with beauties and talents here.

32:04.640 --> 32:07.120
[To create wonders with a brush, Painting of Golden Autumn]

32:04.680 --> 32:06.680
It's a pity if you give up the chance.

32:08.550 --> 32:11.150
What you draw are plants, insects and birds.

32:11.870 --> 32:13.070
There's no portrait.

32:13.670 --> 32:14.470
Are you

32:15.560 --> 32:17.290
capable of portrait painting?

32:17.750 --> 32:19.170
Of course.

32:19.170 --> 32:20.390
Let me show you.

32:31.270 --> 32:34.630
A woman in Marquis Wuyang's robe can also look so good!

32:45.800 --> 32:47.560
[To create wonders with a brush]

32:47.860 --> 32:48.530
Yes.

32:49.120 --> 32:50.460
Keep this posture.

32:50.460 --> 32:51.260
Don't move.

32:51.260 --> 32:53.070
Smile like me.

32:55.920 --> 32:56.510
Blow it.

33:04.240 --> 33:05.500
The squatting friend!

33:06.380 --> 33:07.850
To pick up the flower like an immortal.

33:07.850 --> 33:08.610
To pick up the flower!

33:08.610 --> 33:09.360
To pick up!

33:11.550 --> 33:13.350
Do you know how an immortal picks up the flower?

33:13.350 --> 33:14.410
Get down! Get down!

33:20.240 --> 33:21.250
Your eyes

33:21.250 --> 33:22.380
should be sharper.

33:23.220 --> 33:24.750
How about you be more witty?

33:26.040 --> 33:27.510
It's better to be sharp.

33:31.790 --> 33:32.760
Yes.

33:36.660 --> 33:37.880
The one in white.

33:38.550 --> 33:39.940
Can you play the flute?

33:39.940 --> 33:40.800
Play the flute?

33:45.230 --> 33:45.830
It's done.

33:49.220 --> 33:49.850
Such a lifelike picture,

33:49.850 --> 33:50.520
isn't it?

33:52.370 --> 33:53.340
Wait, this is different

33:53.340 --> 33:55.350
from what you showed us.

33:55.650 --> 33:56.650
Of course.

34:00.730 --> 34:03.120
Why would he draw the portrait of Marquis Wuyang?

34:03.120 --> 34:05.180
This painting must be very important.

34:05.180 --> 34:05.890
Sir.

34:06.520 --> 34:07.720
I think you're lying.

34:08.449 --> 34:09.710
Can you tell the truth?

34:11.100 --> 34:12.110
Well...

34:12.949 --> 34:13.830
What truth?

34:14.540 --> 34:15.780
I don't know what you're talking about.

34:15.780 --> 34:16.560
Liu Shao.

34:17.020 --> 34:17.690
You say it.

34:17.690 --> 34:18.320
I?

34:23.530 --> 34:24.500
There are

34:24.500 --> 34:26.560
many vendors here.

34:26.560 --> 34:28.610
But none of them accept real goods.

34:29.030 --> 34:29.960
It's free.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.510
Everything here is free.

34:31.929 --> 34:33.280
Only you

34:33.280 --> 34:35.040
ask for no test of plant names.

34:35.290 --> 34:36.469
["Let's pick plantains, let's get plantains."]

34:36.590 --> 34:37.270
["I climbed up the hill and collected fritillaries to drive away my sadness; women are sentimental but also have their principles."]

34:36.719 --> 34:39.489
The questions of other vendors are difficult.

34:40.290 --> 34:41.929
But your questions are the simplest.

34:41.929 --> 34:45.409
"The reeds are pale; the dew becomes frost".

34:45.790 --> 34:48.020
It means you deliberately let us find you.

34:48.020 --> 34:49.870
Since you passed my test,

34:49.870 --> 34:51.600
I should draw a picture for you.

34:52.679 --> 34:54.080
The woman in the portrait

34:54.360 --> 34:55.960
was wearing Marquis Wuyang's armor.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.130
[To create wonders with a brush, Painting of Golden Autumn]

34:57.010 --> 35:00.340
But you are only good at drawing flowers, insects and birds.

35:01.040 --> 35:01.960
So,

35:01.960 --> 35:03.620
how did you get this painting?

35:05.990 --> 35:07.090
This only shows

35:09.230 --> 35:12.120
you're different from the others in this fairyland.

35:12.120 --> 35:12.920
That's right.

35:13.470 --> 35:14.690
Otherwise,

35:16.140 --> 35:17.800
maybe you are the master here.

35:20.910 --> 35:22.920
Are you the master of the "Magic Plant Code"?

35:22.920 --> 35:25.180
Then you must know where the King Herb is.

35:25.860 --> 35:26.610
So what?

35:28.040 --> 35:30.440
The "Magic Plant Code" is filled with plants.

35:30.440 --> 35:32.070
They are all my descendants.

35:32.070 --> 35:34.090
This is my world.

35:34.090 --> 35:35.810
So what we see

35:35.810 --> 35:37.030
are all grass demons.

35:37.410 --> 35:39.300
They all grew up in the book.

35:39.300 --> 35:40.810
No wonder they are so fond of literature.

35:40.810 --> 35:42.030
That's right!

35:42.490 --> 35:43.960
I'll make it clear today.

35:44.840 --> 35:46.730
You can't get out.

35:53.160 --> 35:53.700
Give it to me.

35:53.700 --> 35:54.590
What are you doing?

35:54.590 --> 35:56.390
Weren't you arrogant just now?

35:56.390 --> 35:57.850
Let me make it clear today.

35:58.030 --> 35:59.920
This painting is for our freedom.

35:59.920 --> 36:01.780
Is this painting that important?

36:01.800 --> 36:02.860
Why didn't I know?

36:03.930 --> 36:05.090
It doesn't matter.

36:05.350 --> 36:06.200
Little demon, come here.

36:06.200 --> 36:07.330
Burn this painting.

36:07.360 --> 36:07.910
Okay.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.540
So you're from the Aquatic Demon clan.

36:15.540 --> 36:16.510
How dare you fool me?

36:16.510 --> 36:17.600
It's not fun at all.

36:22.380 --> 36:23.710
Fine, I'll send you out.

36:27.510 --> 36:28.690
We're finally back.

36:33.180 --> 36:34.510
I'll teach you a lesson.

36:38.640 --> 36:39.570
Damn fish demon.

36:40.700 --> 36:42.360
You reacted quickly just now.

36:43.220 --> 36:45.420
Were you really going to make a fire ball

36:45.530 --> 36:47.170
and burn that painting?

36:47.880 --> 36:49.810
How should the Aquatic Family set fire?

36:49.810 --> 36:51.410
Please teach me, Mr. Lu.

36:52.040 --> 36:52.920
Anyway,

36:52.920 --> 36:53.980
you did well today.

36:54.390 --> 36:55.150
Go out.

36:55.150 --> 36:55.780
Turn left.

36:55.780 --> 36:57.180
There's a big water tank.

36:58.300 --> 37:00.160
See it as a reward for your action.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.520
You really care about me, don't you?

37:03.090 --> 37:04.420
Are you in need of water?

37:05.860 --> 37:07.290
You... You're dry now.

37:07.290 --> 37:07.870
Hurry up.

37:07.870 --> 37:08.670
Hurry up.

37:10.560 --> 37:11.070
Okay.

37:16.900 --> 37:17.950
Where is that "painter" we met just now?

37:17.950 --> 37:18.960
Where did he go?

37:22.030 --> 37:22.830
Sorry.

37:22.830 --> 37:25.300
I showed up hastily just now.

37:25.680 --> 37:27.820
Let me formally introduce myself.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.500
My name's "Wansui" [long live]!

37:29.500 --> 37:31.100
I'm Father of all plants.

37:31.100 --> 37:32.650
All plants in the mortal world

37:32.650 --> 37:33.910
are my disciples.

37:35.550 --> 37:38.450
However, time has not made me more arrogant,

37:38.450 --> 37:41.680
but endowed me with modesty.

37:41.680 --> 37:43.990
[Pearl Pavilion]

37:48.860 --> 37:50.630
You were so proud in there

37:52.430 --> 37:54.870
just now , weren't you?

37:55.250 --> 37:58.180
I won't tell you any information about the King Herb.

37:58.610 --> 37:59.940
You're quite stubborn.

38:01.300 --> 38:02.430
Forget it.

38:02.430 --> 38:02.960
Let's go.

38:04.190 --> 38:04.870
Let's go.

38:08.860 --> 38:10.030
I'm the ancestor.

38:10.030 --> 38:11.210
How could I not know?

38:12.090 --> 38:12.890
Will you

38:13.310 --> 38:14.270
come back?

38:14.900 --> 38:15.660
No.

38:16.750 --> 38:17.720
Why?

38:17.720 --> 38:18.850
Isn't it fun here?

38:20.910 --> 38:22.370
Without us being with you,

38:22.590 --> 38:23.980
old grass,

38:24.520 --> 38:25.280
you feel lonely now?

38:25.280 --> 38:27.080
You feel the sense of emptiness?

38:27.590 --> 38:28.810
I have the "Magic Plant Code".

38:28.810 --> 38:30.740
The world there suits my heart the most.

38:30.740 --> 38:31.940
Why would I be lonely?

38:32.670 --> 38:33.930
Then just go have fun with

38:33.930 --> 38:35.610
those boring plants.

38:36.030 --> 38:36.870
Enjoy yourself.

38:36.870 --> 38:37.460
Let's go.

38:58.880 --> 39:00.430
It seems that

39:00.430 --> 39:01.770
you can't get out...

39:04.290 --> 39:05.640
What did you say?

39:06.100 --> 39:09.330
Demon King in White entered Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

39:09.330 --> 39:09.960
Yes.

39:09.960 --> 39:11.270
That day, I saw

39:11.270 --> 39:13.110
Demon King in White turned into a fish

39:13.110 --> 39:15.440
and was taken into the Mansion by Liu Shao.

39:16.640 --> 39:18.360
Demon King in White.

39:19.160 --> 39:20.550
A demon

39:21.220 --> 39:23.910
entered the place for hunting demons...

39:26.220 --> 39:28.860
What are you doing?

39:28.860 --> 39:30.750
Just with a drop of Liu Shao's blood,

39:30.750 --> 39:31.850
I can then confirm

39:32.220 --> 39:34.220
if she's the person I'm looking for.

39:37.430 --> 39:40.920
[Pearl Pavilion]

39:41.510 --> 39:42.720
Ten thousand years?

39:43.940 --> 39:45.790
You've lived for 10,000 years.

39:45.790 --> 39:47.430
How have you lived so long?

39:47.930 --> 39:49.780
What did you look like when you were young?

39:49.780 --> 39:51.210
Were you in human form at that time?

39:51.210 --> 39:52.590
Listen to it.

39:52.590 --> 39:53.640
Stupid question.

39:53.640 --> 39:54.190
Yes.

39:54.190 --> 39:55.370
Sorry, I was wrong.

39:55.830 --> 39:56.490
I was wrong.

39:56.750 --> 39:58.730
Were you like the ginseng doll

39:58.730 --> 40:00.910
on New Year paintings?

40:00.910 --> 40:03.140
Will each of your hair

40:03.810 --> 40:06.750
become a herb when it's torn out?

40:06.750 --> 40:08.890
If you're planted in spring,

40:08.890 --> 40:11.830
many more of your fellows will come out in autumn, right?

40:11.830 --> 40:12.920
I don't know!

40:12.920 --> 40:13.960
I have no idea!

40:14.390 --> 40:16.250
Why do you have so many questions?

40:16.530 --> 40:18.260
You do have too many questions.

40:20.230 --> 40:21.320
Do I?

40:22.030 --> 40:22.540
No.

40:24.130 --> 40:24.680
Go ahead.

40:26.150 --> 40:27.030
How about

40:27.750 --> 40:29.510
you answer one or two of my questions first?

40:29.510 --> 40:30.510
What do you think?

40:34.000 --> 40:35.260
This girl

40:35.260 --> 40:36.860
is obviously very innocent.

40:37.030 --> 40:38.370
But you are different.

40:38.370 --> 40:39.570
What's wrong with me?

40:39.840 --> 40:41.170
Do you have any secrets?

40:43.240 --> 40:44.880
What secret can I have?

40:47.070 --> 40:47.570
Fine.

40:48.370 --> 40:49.630
I'll give you a chance.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.680
You can ask me.

40:55.760 --> 40:56.850
Who is your father?

40:58.020 --> 40:59.150
I'm an orphan.

40:59.580 --> 41:01.350
My master brought me up.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.690
Who is your master?

41:02.690 --> 41:03.940
You sly old man.

41:04.120 --> 41:05.380
I've answered your question.

41:05.380 --> 41:06.850
Now it's your turn to answer.

41:06.850 --> 41:07.650
Did we

41:08.070 --> 41:09.490
went up into the "Magic Plant Code"?

41:09.490 --> 41:10.500
Yes.

41:10.500 --> 41:11.640
Who is your master?

41:11.640 --> 41:12.840
My master is Lu Sheng.

41:13.650 --> 41:14.700
Lu Sheng?

41:15.630 --> 41:17.890
I heard about him ten thousand years ago.

41:18.140 --> 41:19.110
Is it true?

41:23.020 --> 41:24.700
Now that you mention it,

41:25.030 --> 41:26.120
I remember it...

41:27.680 --> 41:28.430
What?

41:33.560 --> 41:34.650
My master

41:37.040 --> 41:38.300
mentioned you before.

41:40.110 --> 41:40.820
What?

41:43.430 --> 41:44.310
My master mentioned you before.

41:44.310 --> 41:44.860
Yes.

41:44.860 --> 41:45.230
Say it.

41:45.230 --> 41:45.820
Well...

41:46.280 --> 41:46.960
Lu Li...

41:46.960 --> 41:48.510
Lu Li told me,

41:48.510 --> 41:49.560
his master always said

41:49.560 --> 41:52.040
a King Herb turned into a man ten thousand years ago.

41:52.040 --> 41:53.510
He's good-looking,

41:53.510 --> 41:54.470
and kind.

41:54.470 --> 41:55.440
He's very smart,

41:55.440 --> 41:56.910
and is a very...

41:56.910 --> 41:58.250
A very good demon, right?

41:58.250 --> 41:59.470
A very good demon!

41:59.470 --> 42:00.470
He really said so.

42:01.110 --> 42:02.790
I feel flattered.

42:03.250 --> 42:05.060
But it's true that I'm the ancestor

42:05.060 --> 42:06.020
who is adored

42:06.020 --> 42:07.540
among people and plants,

42:11.110 --> 42:13.000
Shouldn't you tell us now

42:13.370 --> 42:14.550
how to get the King Herb

42:14.550 --> 42:16.150
with the "Magic Plant Code"?

42:17.490 --> 42:19.970
You're trying to trick me out of the secret, right?

42:19.970 --> 42:22.100
You have to obey the rules we agreed on.

42:23.450 --> 42:24.880
Actually, it doesn't matter if I tell you.

42:24.880 --> 42:25.850
But

42:25.850 --> 42:27.650
you have to promise me one thing.

42:28.070 --> 42:28.750
What is it?

42:28.750 --> 42:29.630
What?

42:29.630 --> 42:31.050
You come to play with me every day.

42:31.050 --> 42:32.440
If you can make me happy,

42:32.440 --> 42:34.080
I'll tell you how to plant the King Herb.

42:34.080 --> 42:35.080
What do you think?

42:36.560 --> 42:37.860
Play with you?

42:38.420 --> 42:39.620
I know who can do it.

42:40.210 --> 42:40.920
Who?

42:42.660 --> 42:43.140
He.

42:47.270 --> 42:48.600
The gentleman in white?

42:48.900 --> 42:50.290
Yes, he is my demon.
